        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-4>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-5>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-6>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/2026-10-27-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-audit-delphi10000-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-7>,
