<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-cyanobacteria-mat-turing-wavelength-s0-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cyanobacteria mat Turing ocellus wavelength at 64.19 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — Source and data traceability: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1: Turing 1952, Schnakenberg 1979, Gierer and Meinhardt 1972, Petroff 2010, Shepard and Sumner 2010, and Polerecky et al. 2009 were resolved on OpenAlex or Crossref. The culture-plate SHA-256 is pinned and checked at runtime. Crossref and OpenAlex expose only the family name Armitage for 10.3389/fmicb.2012.00293, so that paper is not given guessed coauthors and is not used as a parameter source. The gallery photograph has no separate licence sidecar." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
